        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG114, Deco Stainless Steel Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe AHI SIG114 stainless steel door lever has a round rose, and a decorative relief grip. This art deco 1930's style is great for a special designer look with unique inspiration. The lever is all stainless steel making it resistant to knocks, scratches and abrasions. The Deco lever has a two tone finish for that extra level of design. The top and bottom of the lever are polished stainless with the center being satin stainless. It is ADA compliant; and will fit standard 2-1/8\" door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 2\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG114-Specification.gif?v=1704354650\" width=\"600\" height=\"176\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Hallow Stainless Steel Lever\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel AHI SIG114 Deco Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For residential or commercial applications</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors)</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Premium latch requires only 28° rotation to retract latchbolt</li>\r\n<li>Meets standards of the <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SIG114 Deco Stainless Steel Lever With Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-15/16\" (126 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\" (54 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 0.31\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/16\" (62 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/8\" (10 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Lever is surface mounted (mounting plate screws to the doors face).</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. For use with a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole pre-drilled door. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Deco Stainless Steel Leverset, AHI SIG114",
                "description": "AHI SIG114, Deco Stainless Steel Leverset - The AHI SIG114 stainless steel door lever has a round rose, and a decorative relief grip. This art deco 1930's style is great for a special designer look with unique inspiration. The lever is all stainless steel making it resistant to knocks, scratches and abrasions. The Deco lever has a two tone finish for that extra level of design. The top and bottom of the lever are polished stainless with the center being satin stainless. It is ADA compliant; and will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.",
